{"availability":"available","full":"imtiazither/eduwork-databridge","name":"eduwork-databridge","description":"Open-source reference framework for governed learning and workforce data interoperability, quality, identity review, lineage, and exports.","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":17,"forks":5,"created":"2026-07-20T19:56:56Z","updated":"2026-10-10T14:23:26Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://imtiazither.github.io/eduwork-databridge/","topics":[],"demo":"https://imtiazither.github.io/eduwork-databridge/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T00:23:28.279Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T00:23:28.279Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T00:23:28.279Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:16:23.554Z","stars":17,"forks":5},{"at":"2026-10-06T15:43:54.965Z","stars":17,"forks":5},{"at":"2026-10-08T16:03:46.383Z","stars":17,"forks":5},{"at":"2026-10-11T00:23:28.279Z","stars":17,"forks":5}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["v0.50.0 connects the identity reviewer desk to the API. Select an organization, search and filter candidates, inspect evidence and decision history, and save a reasoned decision. Revision checks prevent stale saves, and decisions commit with their audit evidence. Read the release notes and upgrade steps.","EduWork DataBridge is an open-source platform for making that reconciliation inspectable. It keeps source evidence, checks the awkward records, separates uncertain identity matches from safe ones, and carries lineage into governed outputs.","One training report may need an employee roster from HR, completion records from an LMS, scores from an assessment file, and awards from a credential system. The joins usually happen in a spreadsheet. When an ID is missing or two accounts look alike, the reasoning can disappear inside the finished report."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/imtiazither/eduwork-databridge/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"eab